From ddb41a01a8049f4ee43d6e6b0434a02b22821aec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keshav Santhanam <ksanthanam@nvidia.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:25:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add self-contained vLLM numerical parity inference

Port the parity-only changes from 026e707815 (original base 880de0fce8)
onto upstream main c035a426e7. Adapt the SSM layout and inference context
integration while preserving main's GDP/MTP/GTP support and sampler.
Retain the 52 vendored kernel files and add main's required replay and
QKV coverage. Separate incompatible parity and dev/SSM dependency extras.

Validation: exact primitive and sampling comparisons, changing-input
CUDA graphs with vLLM blocked, inference/SSM regressions, package and
lock checks, seven full-model cases with all logits and caches exact,
and equivalent native compiler/SSD policies. The 1,636-request stress
rerun is in progress and explicitly marked pending in the documentation.

Signed-off-by: Keshav Santhanam <ksanthanam@nvidia.com>
(cherry picked from commit cfa2b0b4884c8c454bb33627af844286795a2b06)
